{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794551404407,"sessionID":"ses_e2c799d85ffebLHFzdZg0KLfFI","part":{"partID":"prt_1d39955e5001knMEP3Bm257GcL","sessionID":"ses_e2c799d85ffebLHFzdZg0KLfFI","messageID":"msg_1d39941e9001E3SiV1TWu0tJw7","type":"tool","id":"call_7fc559cd653442d6b44ee452","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"limit":120,"offset":2186,"path":".skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml"},"output":"Read file .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml, lines 2186-2305\n2186:   phase_synthesis:\n2187:     purpose: Compile all iteration findings into final research/research.md\n2188:     steps:\n2189: \n2190:       step_fanout_merge:\n2191:         description: \"Merge N lineage registries into one consolidated registry; skip when single-executor\"\n2192:         skip_when: \"config.fanout is absent\"\n2193:         command: |\n2194:           node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-merge.cjs \\\n2195:             --loop-type research \\\n2196:             --artifact-dir {artifact_dir}\n2197:         working_directory: \"{repo_root}\"\n2198:         wait_for_completion: true\n2199: \n2200:       step_hydrate_summary_metrics:\n2201:         action: \"Hydrate summary metrics before synthesis\"\n2202:         read:\n2203:           - \"{state_paths.config}\"\n2204:           - \"{state_paths.state_log}\"\n2205:           - \"{state_paths.registry}\"\n2206:           - \"{state_paths.strategy}\"\n2207:         read_patterns:\n2208:           - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deep-research-state.jsonl\"\n2209:           - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deep-research-strategy.md\"\n2210:         extract:\n2211:           - iteration_count: \"When direct lineage state logs exist, count distinct run values (run, else iteration) across those logs in stable lineage order; otherwise count distinct run values (run, else iteration) across the root state log. Never add root compatibility records to lineage records.\"\n2212:           - highest_run: \"When direct lineage state logs exist, take the highest run value (run, else iteration) across lines where type === 'iteration' in those logs in stable lineage order, else 0; otherwise take the highest run value (run, else iteration) across lines where type === 'iteration' in the root state log, else 0. Never add root compatibility records to lineage records.\"\n2213:           - current_iteration: \"max(highest_run, iteration_count) + 1\"\n2214:           - current_segment: \"Latest segment_start event segment, else 1\"\n2215:           - last_focus: \"Extract focus from latest iteration record, else 'none yet'\"\n2216:           - ratio_prev: \"Extract newInfoRatio from second-latest iteration record, else 'N/A'\"\n2217:           - ratio_latest: \"Extract newInfoRatio from latest iteration record, else 'N/A'\"\n2218:           - remaining_questions: \"Count unchecked items in 'Key Questions'\"\n2219:           - remaining_questions_list: \"List unchecked key questions from strategy.md\"\n2220:           - answered_count: \"Count answered questions from strategy.md\"\n2221:           - total_questions: \"Count total questions tracked in strategy.md\"\n2222:           - last_3_summaries: \"Summarize the latest 3 iteration records as 'run N: focus (ratio)'\"\n2223:           - divergence_summary: \"Read registry.divergence and summarize saturated directions, completed pivots, failures, overrides, Council artifact refs, and remaining frontier; else 'no divergent pivots recorded'\"\n2224:           - reason: \"Use the latest synthesis/recovery stop reason if present, else the frozen default 'converged'. (Must be a member of the STOP_REASONS enum: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused.)\"\n2225: \n2226:       step_read_all_iterations:\n2227:         action: \"Read all iteration files and strategy\"\n2228:         read_patterns:\n2229:           - \"{state_paths.iteration_dir}/iteration-*.md\"\n2230:           - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/iterations/iteration-*.md\"\n2231:         read_also: \"{state_paths.strategy}\"\n2232:         identity: \"Preserve each full source path and lineage label. Duplicate basenames from different lineages are distinct synthesis inputs; do not copy or renumber them.\"\n2233:         selection: \"When lineage iteration files exist, synthesize from those files in stable lineage-plus-iteration order; otherwise use root iterations.\"\n2234: \n2235:       step_emit_resource_map:\n2236:         action: \"Emit {state_paths.resource_map_output} from converged research deltas unless config.resource_map.emit is false\"\n2237:         branch_on: \"config.fanout\"\n2238:         if_present:\n2239:           command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} --emit-resource-map --fanout-resource-map-only\"\n2240:           read:\n2241:             - \"{state_paths.config}\"\n2242:             - \"{state_paths.delta_dir}/iter-*.jsonl\"\n2243:             - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deltas/iter-*.jsonl\"\n2244:         if_absent:\n2245:           command: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/deep-research/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} --emit-resource-map\"\n2246:           read:\n2247:             - \"{state_paths.config}\"\n2248:             - \"{state_paths.delta_dir}/iter-*.jsonl\"\n2249:         write:\n2250:           - \"{state_paths.resource_map_output}\"\n2251:         guarantee: \"Fan-out resource-map emission reads lineage deltas in place and writes only resource-map.md; it never rewrites merged registries, strategy, or dashboard. Single-executor reduction remains unchanged.\"\n2252: \n2253:       step_compile_research:\n2254:         action: \"Compile or finalize research/research.md\"\n2255:         instructions: |\n2256:           If research/research.md exists (progressive synthesis was active):\n2257:             1. Read current research/research.md\n2258:             2. Consolidate and deduplicate findings across all iterations\n2259:             3. Fill any empty sections with findings from iteration files\n2260:             4. Remove redundancy while preserving all unique findings\n2261:             5. Add convergence report as appendix\n2262:             6. If `resource_map_present` is true, cite `{spec_folder}/resource-map.md` in References; otherwise omit any placeholder map citation\n2263:             7. Preserve the mandatory `## Eliminated Alternatives` section, then add or replace `## Divergence Map` immediately after it and before Section 12 Open Questions. Populate it from `{state_paths.registry}` with saturated directions, pivots taken, evidence and Council artifact references, pivot failures and audited overrides, and the remaining frontier.\n2264: \n2265:           If research/research.md does not exist:\n2266:             1. Create research/research.md following 17-section template\n2267:             2. Populate sections from iteration files\n2268:             3. Add citations from original sources\n2269:             4. Note unanswered questions in Open Questions section\n2270:             5. If `resource_map_present` is true, cite `{spec_folder}/resource-map.md` in References; otherwise omit any placeholder map citation\n2271:             6. After the mandatory `## Eliminated Alternatives` section and before Section 12 Open Questions, add `## Divergence Map` with saturated directions, pivots taken, evidence and Council artifact references, pivot failures and audited overrides, and the remaining frontier from `{state_paths.registry}`.\n2272:           Divergence Map documents breadth. Never claim the topic converged merely because divergent mode broadened the investigated frontier.\n2273:           Preserve machine-owned markers so the reducer-owned registry, dashboard, and strategy anchors can be refreshed on re-run without mutating prior synthesis. (Note: `completed-continue` lineage branch is deferred — see `deep-research/references/protocol/loop-protocol.md §Lifecycle Branch Contract`.)\n2274:         output: \"{state_paths.research_output}\"\n2275: \n2276:       step_convergence_report:\n2277:         action: \"Generate and append convergence report\"\n2278:         report: |\n2279:           ## Convergence Report\n2280:           - Stop reason: {reason}\n2281:           - Total iterations: {iteration_count}\n2282:           - Questions answered: {answered_count} / {total_questions}\n2283:           - Remaining questions: {remaining_questions}\n2284:           - Last 3 iteration summaries: {last_3_summaries}\n2285:           - Convergence threshold: {convergence_threshold}\n2286:           - Divergence summary: {divergence_summary}\n2287:           - Segment transitions, wave scores, and checkpoint metrics are experimental and omitted from the live report.\n2288:         command: |\n2289:           GATEWAY=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2290:           [ -f \"$GATEWAY\" ] || GATEWAY=\"scripts/append-mode-event.cjs\"\n2291:           EVENT_DIR=\"$(mktemp -d \"${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/deep-research-synthesis.XXXXXX\")\"\n2292:           CLOSEOUT=\".skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n2293:           [ -f \"$CLOSEOUT\" ] || CLOSEOUT=\"scripts/synthesis-closeout.cjs\"\n2294:           node \"$CLOSEOUT\" --mode research --event-dir \"$EVENT_DIR\" \\\n2295:             --artifact-dir \"{state_paths.packet_dir}\" \\\n2296:             --state-log \"{state_paths.state_log}\" \\\n2297:             --registry \"{state_paths.registry}\" \\\n2298:             --output \"{state_paths.research_output}\" \\\n2299:             --dashboard \"{state_paths.dashboard}\" \\\n2300:             --stop-reason \"{reason}\" \\\n2301:             --answered-count \"{answered_count}\" --total-questions \"{total_questions}\"\n2302:           NODE_STATUS=$?\n2303:           for eventFile in \"$EVENT_DIR\"/*.json; do\n2304:             [ -e \"$eventFile\" ] || continue\n2305:             node \"$GATEWAY\" --mode research --run-directory \"$(dirname \"{state_paths.state_log}\")\" --event-json \"$eventFile\"\n[Output truncated. Continue reading with offset: 2306]","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":true},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file .skilled/commands/deep/assets/deep-research-auto.yaml, lines 2186-2305\n2186:   phase_synthesis:\n2187:     purpose: Compile all iteration findings into final research/research.md\n2188:     steps:\n2189: \n2190:       step_fanout_merge:\n2191:         description: \"Merge N lineage registries into one consolidated registry; skip when single-executor\"\n2192:         skip_when: \"config.fanout is absent\"\n2193:         command: |\n2194:           node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-merge.cjs \\\n2195:             --loop-type research \\\n2196:             --artifact-dir {artifact_dir}\n2197:         working_directory: \"{repo_root}\"\n2198:         wait_for_completion: true\n2199: \n2200:       step_hydrate_summary_metrics:\n2201:         action: \"Hydrate summary metrics before synthesis\"\n2202:         read:\n2203:           - \"{state_paths.config}\"\n2204:           - \"{state_paths.state_log}\"\n2205:           - \"{state_paths.registry}\"\n2206:           - \"{state_paths.strategy}\"\n2207:         read_patterns:\n2208:           - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deep-research-state.jsonl\"\n2209:           - \"{state_paths.packet_dir}/lineages/*/deep-research-strategy.md\"\n2210:         extract:\n2211:           - iteration_count: \"When direct lineage state logs exist, count distinct run values (run, else iteration) across those logs in stable lineage order; otherwise count distinct run values (run, else iteration) across the root state log. Never add root compatibility records to lineage records.\"\n2212:           - highest_run: \"When direct lineage state logs exist, take the highest run value (run, else iteration) across lines where type === 'iteration' in those logs in stable lineage order, else 0; otherwise take the highest run value (run, else iteration) across lines where type === 'iteration' in the root state log, else 0. Never add root compatibility records to lineage records.\"\n2213:           - current_iteration: \"max(highest_run, iteration_count) + 1\"\n2214:           - current_segment: \"Latest segment_start event segment, else 1\"\n2215:           - last_focus: \"Extract focus from latest iteration record, else 'none yet'\"\n2216:           - ratio_prev: \"Extract newInfoRatio from second-latest iteration record, else 'N/A'\"\n2217:           - ratio_latest: \"Extract newInfoRatio from latest iteration record, else 'N/A'\"\n2218:           - remaining_questions: \"Count unchecked items in 'Key Questions'\"\n2219:           - remaining_questions_list: \"List unchecked key questions from strategy.md\"\n2220:           - answered_count: \"Count answered questions from strategy.md\"\n2221:           - total_questions: \"Count total questions tracked in strategy.md\"\n2222:           - last_3_summaries: \"Summarize the latest 3 iteration records as 'run N: focus (ratio)'\"\n2223:           - divergence_summary: \"Read registry.divergence and summarize saturated directions, completed pivots, failures, overrides, Council artifact refs, and remaining frontier; else 'no divergent pivots recorded'\"\n2224:           - reason: \"Use the latest synthesis/recovery stop reason if present, else the frozen default 'converged'. (Must be a member of the STOP_REASONS enum: converged, maxIterationsReached, blockedStop, stuckRecovery, error, manualStop, userPaused.)\"\n2225: \n2226:       step_read_all_iterations:\n2227:         action: \"Read all iteration files and strategy\"\n2228:         read_patterns:\n2229:           - \"{state_paths.iteration_dir}/iteration-*.md\"\n2230:           - \"{state_paths.